@startuml 01-消费与民生域
' 民生甄选 · 业务用例图 L1 · 消费与民生域（UC-BIZ-01 ~ UC-BIZ-08）
' 面向业务干系人，描述端到端业务目标；依据 31 §2.6 + 32 §2
title 民生甄选 · 业务用例图 · 消费与民生域
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "政府" as GOV

rectangle "消费与民生域（业务目标）" {
  usecase "UC-BIZ-01 放心选购商户" as B01
  usecase "UC-BIZ-02 透明明白消费" as B02
  usecase "UC-BIZ-03 投诉维权追进度" as B03
  usecase "UC-BIZ-04 反映民生诉求" as B04
  usecase "UC-BIZ-05 建言献策" as B05
  usecase "UC-BIZ-06 监督民生项目" as B06
  usecase "UC-BIZ-07 承办限时办结" as B07
  usecase "UC-BIZ-08 回应民意公开项目" as B08
}

CONSUMER --> B01
CONSUMER --> B02
CONSUMER --> B03
CONSUMER --> B04
CONSUMER --> B05
CONSUMER --> B06
GOV --> B07
GOV --> B08

B03 ..> B02 : <<extend>>
note right of B03
  消费遇坑后延伸维权（业务层建模关系）
end note
@enduml
